    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <section class="about">
    <div>
      <p class="about-label">About Us</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-body">
      <p>We've worked with many of the most innovative companies in the world on large scale, strategic product and brand initiatives. We've built products used daily by hundreds of millions of people and created brands that changed industries.</p>
      <p>We've won multiple industry awards, including Webby Awards, Red Dot Design Awards, D&amp;AD Pencils, Cannes Lions, FWA's, Awwwards, and many more. We've been named one of the Ad Age best places to work, and we landed on the Inc. 5000 with the fastest growing companies in the U.S. multiple times.</p>
